User Story:
As a user,
I want to be able to read instructions on how to conduct a sprint retrospective,
so that I can understand how to conduct one.

Test Scenarios:
Explicit:
Verify that the user can open the website.
Verify that the user can find the Sprint Retrospective button/section.
Verify that the user can click the Sprint Retrospective button.
Verify that the Sprint Retrospective instructions are displayed.
Verify that the instructions are readable.


Implicit:
Verify that the website loads without errors.
Verify that the Sprint Retrospective button is visible and easy to identify.
Verify that the button is clickable.
Verify that clicking the button opens the correct Sprint Retrospective content.
Verify that the page does not display unrelated or incorrect information.
Verify that the text is displayed properly without being cut off or overlapping.
Verify that the user can read the instructions on different screen sizes.